  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Airport Emergency and Operations Management Pilot Project and Feasibility Study, through Veoci</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a pilot project and feasibility study for the Airports Authority of India (AAI) to assess the viability of implementing a cloud-based emergency management and operations system at AAI-managed airports. The activity would pilot Veoci, an emergency management and operations software solution developed by U.S. firm Grey Wall Software LLC, at five airports in India, as well as at AAI headquarters in New Delhi and at five regional headquarters locations.</narrative>
  </description>
